within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.C_CardiovascularSystem.C02A_AntiadrenergicAgentsCentrallyActing.C02AC01_Clonidine;
model Clonidine_Bardol2025_PD_comfort_b
  "sigmoid_emax exposure-response sweep — Bardol_2025 :: COMFORT‐B (COMFORT‐B score)"
  extends Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep(
    E0 = 15.6,      // [1]
    Emax = -6,  // [1]
    EC50 = 2.73e-06,  // [kg/m3; ng/mL × 1e-06]
    gamma = 1,
    exposure_per_s = 1e-06);   // 1 ng/mL per second
  // imax_as_negative_emax: Imax (Q323) enters SigmoidEmaxSweep as −Emax
  // defaulted: gamma
  annotation(experiment(StartTime = 0, StopTime = 28, Interval = 0.056),
    Documentation(info = "<html><body><h4>Clonidine_Bardol2025_PD_comfort_b</h4><p>The steady-state exposure-response curve of Bardol M et al., <i>Paediatric anaesthesia 35(12):1053–1062</i> 2025 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1111/pan.70050\">doi:10.1111/pan.70050</a>) — COMFORT‐B score against clonidine ng/mL — obtained by sweeping the driver instead of simulating a dose. Model family: sigmoid_emax.</p><h4>The parameters, in the paper's terms</h4><pre>  E0    =       15.6          drug-free response (baseline) (B0, Q324)
  Emax  =          6          maximal effect term (Emax, Q323)
  EC50  =       2.73 ng/mL    exposure at half of the maximal effect term (EC50, Q321)
  gamma = (library default) Hill coefficient</pre><p>The algebra is <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep\">SigmoidEmaxSweep</a>; this model only supplies the numbers. The x axis is one ng/mL of clonidine per second of simulated time (exposure is in kg/m3): there is no state, no dose and no kinetics — plot <code>response</code> against <code>exposure</code> (or <code>time</code>).</p><h4>What it reproduces</h4><pre>  exposure = 0         response 15.6   (drug-free)
  exposure = EC50 (2.73 ng/mL)  response 12.6
  exposure -> infinity  response 9.6</pre></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Bardol_2025: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: accepted with caveats</li></ul></body></html>"));
end Clonidine_Bardol2025_PD_comfort_b;
